    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "key-concepts",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "KEY CONCEPTS:\n\n1. Pattern-Driven: Rubrics emerge from actual code patterns, not framework labels\n2. Criterion Adaptation: Standards contextualized to codebase reality (ADAPT/ADOPT/DOCUMENT)\n3. Hierarchical: Universal > Pattern > Sub-pattern > Domain (weighted composition)\n4. Evolutionary: Discovered rubrics feed back into formula steps and teaching methods\n5. Real-time: MCP web search for current best practices, contextualized to business domain",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#333",
      "originalText": "KEY CONCEPTS:\n\n1. Pattern-Driven: Rubrics emerge from actual code patterns, not framework labels\n2. Criterion Adaptation: Standards contextualized to codebase reality (ADAPT/ADOPT/DOCUMENT)\n3. Hierarchical: Universal > Pattern > Sub-pattern > Domain (weighted composition)\n4. Evolutionary: Discovered rubrics feed back into formula steps and teaching methods\n5. Real-time: MCP web search for current best practices, contextualized to business domain",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "example-box",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 140,
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeColor": "#adb5bd"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "example-text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 1110,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "EXAMPLE FLOW:\n\n1. Scan finds package.json with 'react' -> Load 'frontend-component' template\n2. Exploration finds useState in 5 files, Zustand in 2 -> Evidence: state_management = 7\n3. Threshold check: 7 > 0.7 threshold -> TRIGGER discovery\n4. MCP search: 'React state management best practices 2025' + 'Zustand vs useState when to use'\n5. Criterion Adaptation: Standard says 'useState for local only' but codebase uses prop drilling -> ADAPT\n6. Generated criterion: 'Spec must document when useState holds local vs shared state (via prop drilling)'\n7. Update: Eval rubric (immediate) -> Formula steps (next cycle) -> Teaching methods (long-term)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#333",
      "originalText": "EXAMPLE FLOW:\n\n1. Scan finds package.json with 'react' -> Load 'frontend-component' template\n2. Exploration finds useState in 5 files, Zustand in 2 -> Evidence: state_management = 7\n3. Threshold check: 7 > 0.7 threshold -> TRIGGER discovery\n4. MCP search: 'React state management best practices 2025' + 'Zustand vs useState when to use'\n5. Criterion Adaptation: Standard says 'useState for local only' but codebase uses prop drilling -> ADAPT\n6. Generated criterion: 'Spec must document when useState holds local vs shared state (via prop drilling)'\n7. Update: Eval rubric (immediate) -> Formula steps (next cycle) -> Teaching methods (long-term)",
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
